# YUI Project Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [Unreleased]

## [1.0.0] - 2026-10-15

### Added

- AI providers: OpenAI, Google Gemini, DeepSeek, Kimi (Moonshot), Anthropic Claude and a
  custom OpenAI-compatible server, picked as Seed Server + Core Program. Each server keeps its
  own model, address and access key.
- Scan Cores: fetch the current model list from the server; Manual Core ID for any model id.
- Streaming replies (text appears as it is generated), with Cancel to stop a reply and a
  regenerate button on Yui's last reply.
- Conversation memory: recent messages are sent as context, and the last 50 messages are kept
  across restarts.
- Yui knows the current date and time.
- Multi-line input: Enter sends, Shift+Enter starts a new line.
- Registered Parent: Yui calls you Papa or Mama.
- Yui's Heart: long-term memories Yui saves herself, viewable and editable in the Cardinal
  System dialog.
- Emotion Display: Yui changes her expression with the mood of each reply (optional images).
- Navigation Pixie Form: with a pixie image set, Yui turns into a small hovering pixie while the
  message window is hidden.
- Standby Mode: Yui falls asleep after a while without interaction; click her to wake her up.
- Login Greeting: Yui welcomes you back after you have been away.
- Mental Health Counseling: reminders to sleep late at night and to rest after long sessions.
- Navigation Reports: warnings about low battery and high CPU or memory usage.
- Navigation: Yui can offer to open a page or a search; it is confirmed in SAO Utils' system
  message box and opened by SAO Utils (or the system browser with External Browser on).
- "System Call" easter egg: Sacred Arts element commands from Alicization.
- SAO-style scroll bars and a comic-style tail on Yui's message bubbles.
- Message font size setting.
- Translations: all interface text can be localized (`i18n/`, `Locales/`); Chinese descriptions
  are included.

### Changed

- Settings renamed after SAO: "Cardinal System" (formerly Core Settings) and "Equipment"
  (formerly Style Settings), with a description under each setting.
- The character image keeps its aspect ratio and is centered; the message window fills the
  remaining width. Minimum size: 300 x 400 for the character, room for the input row beside it.
- Hiding the message window shrinks the widget to the character and showing it restores the
  previous size; the widget can still be resized either way.
- Error messages are written in Yui's voice.
- Fonts are saved by name instead of list position.
- Settings from 0.0.2 (API key, endpoint and model) are migrated automatically.

### Fixed

- The selected model did not match the model actually sent to the API.
- A custom API endpoint was overwritten when switching models.
- The settings dialogs could only be opened once.
- The background image setting had no effect, and a chosen Field background reset to the
  default after a restart (set it again once after updating).
- Long text without spaces overflowed the message bubbles; replies could be shown as rich text.
- The chat did not always scroll to the newest message.
- Requests that never answered left the chat stuck; they now time out.

## [0.0.2] - 2025-12-24

### Changed

- Updated README.md
- Optimized Settings UI
- Optimized code logic

## [0.0.1] - 2025-12-22

